# Roblox API Reference

This is an unofficial reference for the Roblox Engine API classes & enums.

## Development

Install Bun and rustup, then run:

    bun install
    bun vp run setup
    bun vp run dev

`bun vp run` lists every task. See AGENTS.md for how the build works.

## Disclaimer

This is NOT affiliated with Roblox Corporation.
